# What the sdist carries beyond the package itself.
#
# setuptools' default sdist packs files matching `test*.py` and nothing else
# from tests/, which quietly shipped 23 test modules WITHOUT conftest.py or
# fake_acp_agent.py. Measured on the 0.2.0 sdist: `pytest -q tests/` gave
# 12 failed, 259 passed, 276 errors, almost all of them `fixture 'repo' not
# found`. A suite that cannot run is worse than an absent one — it invites a
# packager to conclude the package is broken.
#
# Ship a runnable suite or ship none. This ships one, and release.yml gates
# on conftest.py actually being in the tarball.
graft tests
include conftest.py
include SPEC_*.md
include CHANGELOG.md
include SECURITY.md
graft schema
prune tests/__pycache__
global-exclude *.pyc
global-exclude .DS_Store
